Status
------
No Compass code is committed. build-compass-web.sh fetches Compass at the commit above and builds it with compass-web.patch
(the only change to Compass: a same-origin WebSocket address, one fixed connection, no AI or Atlas features, no utility
workers). The built bundle is git-ignored (web/public/compass-web/) and only enters an image built with BUILD_COMPASS=1.
Compass code must never be copied into files outside web/compass-island/ and crates/compass/. Record the upstream commit above
each time it changes (the script reads it from here), and keep THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md in the repository root in sync.
